status: accept
exit: 42
covers: op_symbol is_clause place_uses_clause quantifiers quantifier law_decl
note: |
  An algebra is a place declared `is algebra`: its operations and its laws,
  stated with the symbols of logic over its own name. A place that `uses
  algebra` is a model: it gives each operation as its own fun, and every law
  is certified on it (here exhaustively, on the two arms of Coin).
